usk/status/2090597441552679012?s=20", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "\nElon Musk\n:\nWe\u2019re aiming to reach 30+ Starship launches/day in 2030, which is ~10k annualized. \n\nStill tiny numbers compared to airplane flights!\n", "last_comment_created": 1787307364018, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 2, "score_up": 32, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"twitter": {"quotedTweet": false, "images": false, "linkEmbed": false, "replies": 431, "created": 1787272246000, "id": "2090597441552679012", "video": false, "poll": false, "user": {"profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2053244804520427520/m8mdWZCG_normal.jpg", "displayName": "Elon Musk", "username": "elonmusk"}, "content": "@aaronburnett We\u2019re aiming to reach 30+ Starship launches/day in 2030, which is ~10k annualized. \n\nStill tiny numbers compared to airplane flights!", "parentTweet": {"quotedTweet": {"quotedTweet": false, "images": [{"width": 1206, "heightRatio": 102, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQMeGI4WQAA_T4c.jpg", "height": 1232}], "linkEmbed": false, "replies": 0, "created": 1787260398000, "id": "2090547746918854746", "video": false, "poll": false, "user": {"profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2036415476335833088/WPlUcJxT_normal.jpg", "displayName": "Director Michael Kratsios", "username": "mkratsios47"}, "content": "Today @POTUS signed a new National Space Transportation Policy, one that meets this moment of explosive growth and positions America to lead the next era of space.\n\u00a0\nIn the 13 years since the last update to the Policy, U.S. launches have surged 10x: from 19 successful orbital", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 3074}, "images": false, "linkEmbed": false, "replies": 0, "created": 1787268033000, "id": "2090579773185470587", "video": false, "poll": false, "user": {"profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2049987217477513216/GJx9_LdR_normal.jpg", "displayName": "Aaron Burnett", "username": "aaronburnett"}, "content": "1,000 launches/reentries is the goal. FAA was forecasting 385 by 2030 in their bull case. This is a statement by administration to start taking launch scale seriously. \n\nFor context, our conservative model estimating ~940 launches by SpaceX alone by 2030. \n\nSpaceX publicly stated", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 699}, "likes": 6658}}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATCNPKtmf", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 10, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8791405, "raw_content": "\"US sees a big jump in nausea cases among frequent marijuana users in the hospital\" https://apnews.com/article/marijuana-vomiting-nausea-cannabis-hyperemesis-syndrome-f8d270504b13614df87e45229b0acf93\n\nhttps://my.clevelandclinic.org/health/diseases/21665-cannabis-hyperemesis-syndrome\n\nMore frequent marijuana users being treated with nausea and vomiting condition: Report  https://thehill.com/policy/healthcare/6017002-frequent-marijuana-users-treatmment-chs-vomiting-condition/\n\nER visits for brutal \u2018scromiting\u2019 weed disorder have gone up nearly 400% since October \u2014 here\u2019s why   https://nypost.com/2026/08/11/health/er-visits-for-scromiting-disorder-up-nearly-400-since-october/", "author": "OrangeManNotBad", "created": 1787311552544, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "OrangeManNotBad", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutio